The Mirror Typing workflow adapts the broadcast-input proposal and concepts
contributed by Rafael Ruscher (@ruscher) in OMXTerm PR #622, with attribution
to Community Big and BigLinux. It is a narrower typing-only implementation,
not a wholesale merge of that contribution. AshyTerm's applicable MIT notice
is preserved in full in licenses/ashyterm.txt (Copyright 2024 Community Big).

The archive bundles OMXTerm's shared application-page controls, layout and UI
tokens under the MIT license in LICENSE. Core owns input routing; extension
code neither receives keyboard payloads nor persists mirroring authority.
